{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:47:727","content":{"id":727,"title":"矩阵中的最长递增路径","content":[{"type":"header","disableDrag":false,"level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"08cacd32-810f-4b8e-a51b-38e09eb5adb6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"题目描述"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"abc44274-f767-4c13-934d-42b3ec77b22e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"给定一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"m x n"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 整数矩阵 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"matrix"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，找出其中"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"最长递增路径"},{"type":"formatted","text":"的长度。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"27093051-c393-4f0f-b707-ca51b18d2e0c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于每个单元格，你可以往上，下，左，右四个方向移动。不能在对角线方向上移动或移动到边界外（即不允许环绕）。"}]},{"type":"detail","title":"示例 1","open":true,"tauContract":"6f651c7baafe7521ca6995109244b4d914c31407a4c181a83538b42acd722b1e","collabId":"0214132b-f887-4fe8-a7c5-914d93967a37","children":[{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_96af2713-0018-4a2a-800e-bb125b5160a5.webp","uuid":"14b0be31-7642-4c86-823c-1682f8e2aaef","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_96af2713-0018-4a2a-800e-bb125b5160a5.webp","width":100.83332932657682,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"f2e71470-bce8-43ec-902d-a0a20082ed0e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2b57f2e0-b3f0-422c-8d39-5dcd990fbddd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"输入："},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"matrix = [[9,9,4],[6,6,8],[2,1,1]]"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3f608161-3abb-4bf8-ad43-17e49bd36727","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"输出："},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"4"},{"type":"formatted","text":" "}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"93882ead-146d-4704-949d-6d07e1f0964b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解释：最长递增路径为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"[1, 2, 6, 9]"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]}]},{"type":"detail","title":"示例 2","open":true,"tauContract":"6f651c7baafe7521ca6995109244b4d914c31407a4c181a83538b42acd722b1e","collabId":"b0cfc050-7450-4996-9f37-4593f8c1c47b","children":[{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_1422db66-a21e-499d-87da-48f2d641700e.webp","uuid":"e2c03814-d69b-48ef-b46c-ec2b03112881","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_1422db66-a21e-499d-87da-48f2d641700e.webp","width":105.41666247778485,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"c9a293c5-3b7e-4fcf-81ed-d7abebdde8ec","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8a71b765-7a40-453c-91c1-8fb48f62e882","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"输入："},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"matrix = [[3,4,5],[3,2,6],[2,2,1]]"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2a996dfb-d7dc-4d54-8112-1f5f6ad955e4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"输出："},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"4"},{"type":"formatted","text":" "}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8c8491b6-15c7-41ff-b926-f1501ddf20dd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解释：最长递增路径是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"[3, 4, 5, 6]"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。注意不允许在对角线方向上移动。"}]}]},{"type":"header","disableDrag":false,"level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"f26a1b3f-e5f6-4e43-82b7-aaf1122ab250","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解题思路"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"72d014df-ecb8-4882-90d2-34dd74d468e7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这是一个图的深度优先遍历遍历问题，遍历整个矩阵，从矩阵的每一个元素出发，看看可以连接到哪些数字"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"68d075b6-8641-4096-998d-5f0c4eb2aa38","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"78e5b88b-124f-475d-b968-366d6fd10e88","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"function longestIncreasingPath(matrix: number[][]): number {\n  if (matrix.length === 0) return 0;\n  const m = matrix.length;\n  const n = matrix[0].length;\n\n  const visited = Array.from({ length: m }).map(() => Array.from({ length: n }).fill(false)) as boolean[][];\n  let count = 0;\n  for (let i = 0; i < m; i++) {\n    for (let j = 0; j < n; j++) {\n      count = Math.max(search(matrix, i, j, visited), count);\n    }\n  }\n\n  return count;\n};\n\nconst directions = [\n  [-1, 0],\n  [0, -1],\n  [1, 0],\n  [0, 1]\n]\n\nfunction search(matrix: number[][], i: number, j: number, visited: boolean[][], acc = 0): number {\n  if (visited[i][j]) return acc;\n  const m = matrix.length;\n  const n = matrix[0].length;\n\n  visited[i][j] = true;\n  let max = acc + 1;\n  for (let dir of directions) {\n    const nextRow = i + dir[0];\n    const nextCol = j + dir[1];\n    if (nextRow >= 0 && nextRow < m && nextCol >= 0 && nextCol < n && matrix[nextRow][nextCol] > matrix[i][j]) {\n      max = Math.max(search(matrix, nextRow, nextCol, visited, acc + 1), max);\n    }\n  }\n\n  visited[i][j] = false;\n\n  return max;\n}","collabId":"a9bf57f8-1a67-41a6-8459-119c1b2c5a88","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2126a182-7c68-4d92-8623-61e6f7d34226","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"缺点是时间复杂度呈指数级增长，实际上我们观察有很多重复的计算，从一个点出发的最大增长长度是固定的，和从哪里到这个点无关，因为上一个点肯定比当前点小，这样才能遍历到当前节点，遍历的方向一定不会有回头的情况的，因此可以缓存从某个点开始的最大增长序列，后续不用重复计算，使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"memo[i][j]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示从 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"(i, j)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 出发的最大增长长度，由于如果遍历过节点后，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"memo[i][j]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的最小值是 1，因此可以使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"memo"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 替代 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"visited"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"26b38826-37e3-405f-8797-b754b2918389","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"5125b2b7-580f-4106-8ea9-f066568a8400","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"function longestIncreasingPath(matrix: number[][]): number {\n  if (matrix.length === 0) return 0;\n  const m = matrix.length;\n  const n = matrix[0].length;\n\n  const memo = Array.from({ length: m }).map(() => Array.from({ length: n }).fill(0)) as number[][];\n  let count = 0;\n  for (let i = 0; i < m; i++) {\n    for (let j = 0; j < n; j++) {\n      count = Math.max(search(matrix, i, j, memo), count);\n    }\n  }\n\n  return count;\n};\n\nconst directions = [\n  [-1, 0],\n  [0, -1],\n  [1, 0],\n  [0, 1]\n]\n\nfunction search(matrix: number[][], i: number, j: number, memo: number[][]): number {\n  if (memo[i][j]) return memo[i][j];\n  const m = matrix.length;\n  const n = matrix[0].length;\n\n  let max = 1;\n  for (let dir of directions) {\n    const nextRow = i + dir[0];\n    const nextCol = j + dir[1];\n    if (nextRow >= 0 && nextRow < m && nextCol >= 0 && nextCol < n && matrix[nextRow][nextCol] > matrix[i][j]) {\n      max = Math.max(search(matrix, nextRow, nextCol, memo) + 1, max);\n    }\n  }\n\n  memo[i][j] = max;\n\n  return max;\n}","collabId":"00674e86-42da-4c61-86f6-28e44c5d1621","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","disableDrag":false,"level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"179bb3b9-dd10-42a2-ad5e-b17b213727b5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"f479c738-7872-459b-93b8-bb54562e96f6","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"a98202a7-cd2a-442b-b521-cd01bbf93c94","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"453a669d-f714-445a-bb8d-a21ce2f2047d","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://leetcode.cn/problems/fpTFWP/description/","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"b35cc42c-935a-4467-ab54-3daee6242456","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"LCR 112. 矩阵中的最长递增路径"}]}]}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"LeetCode","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:718","type":"doc","id":718}},{"label":"深度优先遍历"},{"label":"矩阵中的最长递增路径","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:727","type":"doc","id":727}}],"prevPage":{"title":"组合总数","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:710","type":"doc","id":710}},"nextPage":{"title":"罗马数字与数字的转换","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:697","type":"doc","id":697}},"createTime":1745559657111,"updateTime":1775929217401,"projectId":47},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1775929217401}}